<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ High Court upholds NZCC's Ravensdown decision.</title>
<headline>NZ High Court upholds NZCC's Ravensdown decision.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The High Court has upheld the Commerce Commission's decision to decline an application by Ravensdown Corp Ltd to buy all the shares in SouthFert Co-operative Ltd, the commission said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Ravensdown and SouthFert are the only importers, manufacturers and wholesale suppliers of fertiliser in the South Island.</p>
<p>The commission said it was not satisfied that the combined company would not be dominant in each of its South Island markets. -- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
